op {
  graph_op_name: "Reciprocal"
  summary: "Computes the reciprocal of x element-wise."
  description: <<END
I.e., \\(y = 1 / x\\).

CPU kernels support only floating-point and complex types. GPU kernels also
support `int64`. There are no CPU or GPU kernels for `int8`, `int16`, or `int32`.
END
}
